# VIBRA LOOK app — copy to .env.local (never committed).
# Base URL of vibralook-api, no trailing slash. Empty in development = simulated services (UI work only).
#   Android emulator / USB device with `adb reverse tcp:3000 tcp:3000`: http://127.0.0.1:3000
#   Phone on the same Wi-Fi: http://<your-computer-LAN-IP>:3000
#   Release builds: https://api.example.com (HTTPS required)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
